> what do you mean by asyncTeleport? loading chunks before teleporting?

From Essentials. On new versions u can use just entity.teleportAsync(Location)
```java
 public static CompletableFuture<Boolean> teleportAsync(final Entity entity, final Location location, final PlayerTeleportEvent.TeleportCause cause) {
        final int x = location.getBlockX() >> 4;
        final int z = location.getBlockZ() >> 4;

        return getChunkAtAsync(location.getWorld(), x, z, true, true).thenApply(chunk -> entity.teleport(location, cause));
    }

    public static CompletableFuture<Chunk> getChunkAtAsync(final World world, final int x, final int z, final boolean gen, final boolean isUrgent) {
        final CompletableFuture<Chunk> future = new CompletableFuture<>();
        Objects.requireNonNull(future);
        final World.ChunkLoadCallback chunkLoadCallback = future::complete;
        world.getChunkAtAsync(x, z, chunkLoadCallback);
        return future;
    }
```

