As described above, metadata along with the sprint state is kept after respawn, only the attribute modifiers are lost.

`keepAttributes = false`
results in
`packet.hasFlag((byte)1)` being `false`
results in
`setBaseFrom()` being called instead of `setFrom()`
results in
speed modifier being lost on respawn, while sprinting state itself is kept

